,"shared_category_count":1},{"business_id":"JhpRI9m71ybWHkAqRdL0Tg","name":"The Avenue Pub","shared_categories":"Restaurants","shared_category_count":1},{"business_id":"_Bi9kN_eR75G1eqIl7S3pA","name":"The Bulldog","shared_categories":"Restaurants","shared_category_count":1},{"business_id":"AU-B663F3MPO7W-goWwwXA","name":"B Mac's","shared_categories":"","shared_category_count":0},{"business_id":"pKykk7lnD6Tf9wSzJYRyJA","name":"Starbucks","shared_categories":"","shared_category_count":0}],"text":[{"business_id":"isuOwjnrPrr1bRELgQM0aA","review_id":"BIsImwpUmNA6rOt2J54wvA","date":"2013-04-16T00:30:24","stars":4,"text_representativeness":0.9416530132293701,"text_excerpt":"Tan Dinh's skinnier relative - menu's a little smaller but just as good My parents wanted something healthy and suggested Vietnamese and I initially said no because I really only like to eat Vietnamese on the West Bank or in the east and I didn't want to go that far, then I remembered Eater NOLA sent something out about a soft opening of Ba Chi UPTOWN!! Today was the first day of their soft opening. They're actually opening next week. We were very happy we went. We shared 2 appetizers and 2 entrees between the three of us and we were very full. We ordered the vietnamese coffee (drip coffee with condensed milk) served over ice and some ice tea and our total was $29 for everything. Tried th..."},{"business_id":"isuOwjnrPrr1bRELgQM0aA","review_id":"QpcOzBUCePlXe_JsYzigww","date":"2013-10-12T04:27:21","stars":4,"text_representativeness":0.939456582069397,"text_excerpt":"I really like this place, and have been here twice now. I've only gotten the \"bacos\" - like tacos but with a steamed bun instead of the tortilla. On my last visit, I got 3 bacos - coconut shrimp, curry chicken and BBQ pork. All of them were delicious. The interior is fairly nondescript, although there is a nice little covered patio area as well."},{"business_id":"isuOwjnrPrr1bRELgQM0aA","review_id":"Xzj5TKU1S22aoHyfG9axBg","date":"2013-06-07T20:15:35","stars":4,"text_representativeness":0.9351891875267029,"text_excerpt":"Yes yes. Ba Chi did not disappoint. I was delighted when I arrived here and I was seated on the enclosed patio on a nice (but rainy) evening. It made for a nice atmosphere, even though it was a little humid. We started with a couple of pork spring rolls. While they weren't the best I have ever had, they were definitely tasty and the pork was cooked to perfection. For my meal I decided on the Pho with rare flank and brisket. It was out of this world. Not only was I served a huge bowl that was packed to the brim with meat and noodles, but the broth had a lot of flavor. It was so yum and the brisket was cooked to perfection and piled high in the Pho. It made for an amazing meal. I have to sa..."}],"visual":[{"business_id":"isuOwjnrPrr1bRELgQM0aA","photo_id":"9rep5qAxymVok3EFvSuHSQ","label":"inside","image_url":"/photos/9rep5qAxymVok3EFvSuHSQ.jpg","visual_representativeness":0.8874220848083496},{"business_id":"isuOwjnrPrr1bRELgQM0aA","photo_id":"uC-hD6KVyvM4fl6smG-cMA","label":"menu","image_url":"/photos/uC-hD6KVyvM4fl6smG-cMA.jpg","visual_representativeness":0.8319095969200134},{"business_id":"isuOwjnrPrr1bRELgQM0aA","photo_id":"JrTJ8L3DXsmDBqGE0FnX7Q","label":"drink","image_url":"/photos/JrTJ8L3DXsmDBqGE0FnX7Q.jpg","visual_representativeness":0.8275420069694519},{"business_id":"isuOwjnrPrr1bRELgQM0aA","photo_id":"vAzNKjvi6CNtvTOSDPVnEA","label":"outside","image_url":"/photos/vAzNKjvi6CNtvTOSDPVnEA.jpg","visual_representativeness":0.8233257532119751},{"business_id":"isuOwjnrPrr1bRELgQM0aA","photo_id":"m0JjuJ7ycuaWWXGpqAx65g","label":"food","image_url":"/photos/m0JjuJ7ycuaWWXGpqAx65g.jpg","visual_representativeness":0.8060717582702637}]},"notebook_case":null}
